        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Big Hero 6\n- People: Ryan Potter\n- Companies: Marvel Comics, Disney\n- Roles: Hiro Hamada, Mike Fukanaga\n- Topics: animated feature films, superhero teams, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Big Hero 6 is loosely based on the Marvel Comics superhero team of the same name.\n- Big Hero 6 is the 54th Disney animated feature film.\n- Ryan Potter began his professional acting career at age 15.\n- Ryan Potter is known for starring as Mike Fukanaga in Supah Ninjas.\n- Ryan Potter voiced Hiro Hamada in Big Hero 6 (2014).",
